1. vosk-browser 0.0.8 (vosk.js)
   https://github.com/ccoreilly/vosk-browser
   https://www.npmjs.com/package/vosk-browser/v/0.0.8
   Includes Vosk (https://github.com/alphacep/vosk-api) and Kaldi
   (https://github.com/kaldi-asr/kaldi), compiled to WebAssembly.
   Modified: vosk.js embeds its Web Worker as base64. tools/extract_worker.py
   saves that worker as vosk-worker.js, decoded exactly as vosk.js would, and
   empties the now-unused base64 string in vosk.js. Nothing else is changed.

